## Catalog Management in V1

In V1, the variants table is populated in two ways only. No platform API calls of any kind.

### Bulk CSV import
Merchant uploads a CSV following this exact template:
```
master_sku,product_title,variant_title,barcode
AERO-BLK-09,Air Runner,Black / Size 9,1234567890123
AERO-BLK-10,Air Runner,Black / Size 10,1234567890124
FOAM-GRY-09,FoamStep,Grey / Size 9,1234567890125
SOCK-WHT-OS,Running Socks,Default,
```
Processed via CatalogImportJob in Sidekiq. Turbo Stream broadcasts progress and completion.

### Manual entry via UI
Merchant adds individual variants through a form in the variants section of the app.

