## Catalog Sync Strategy — Future Platform Integration Phase

When Shopify or any other platform integration is added:

1. **Full pull on install** — immediately after OAuth, pull entire product and variant catalog from the platform API, populate variants table, fill all platform fields
2. **Webhooks** — subscribe to product create, update, delete events to keep variants table in sync in real time
3. **Daily full re-sync** — once per day re-pull full catalog and reconcile, catch anything webhooks missed, update catalog_synced_at on the merchant record
4. **Pre-sync validation** — before writing inventory to the platform, validate every platform_variant_id still exists and is active

