## V2 — Build After V1 Is Stable and Tested

- PDF invoice ingestion
- AI-assisted mapping suggestions — if supplier file has a description or product name column alongside the supplier code, use it to suggest likely variant matches to the merchant during manual mapping
- Shopify platform integration:
  - OAuth install and callback flow
  - Full catalog pull on install populating variants table
  - Webhooks for real-time catalog sync (products/create, products/update, products/delete)
  - Inventory write via Shopify Inventory API using platform_inventory_id
  - Per-row sync logging (success, failed, skipped)
  - Rate limit handling for Shopify API calls
- Multi-location inventory support
- Mapping health dashboard — visual overview of dictionary health, stale mappings, unresolved code rate, sync history per supplier
- Supplier-level analytics — upload frequency, resolution rate, unknown code rate per supplier

